        <item quantity="other">%d recordings</item>
    </plurals>
    <string name="rec_files_footer">Recordings stay in CallCtrl\'s private storage, left out of every backup and behind the app lock. Nothing leaves the phone unless you share a recording or save copies to Music. Delete after only removes CallCtrl\'s own copies.</string>
    <string name="rec_notice_title">Before you record calls</string>
    <string name="rec_notice_body">In Belgium you may record a call you take part in yourself. Using or sharing the recording is restricted: you generally need the other person\'s consent, and you may not make it public. Tell the other person you\'re recording.\n\nOther countries have other rules. You\'re responsible for following the law where you are.</string>
